# THE WORD "GOD" IS NOT GOD
# First full Burning Wheel rant choreography.
# Commands execute top-to-bottom. SAY waits for the voice to finish.

AUTOCHAOS OFF
RESET
EYE wide 2.2
GESTURE flare 0.35
SAY BE NOT AFRAID. Actually, that's unreasonable. Be somewhat afraid.

BEAT 250ms
EYE smug 4
GESTURE leanIn 0.55
SAY You silly fuckin’ finite primates are attempting to discuss the fucking condition of possibility for fucking existence using NOISES produced by vibrating meat (lol) and somehow you’ve have convinced yourselves that the Absolute is a celestial bureaucrat with an unusually elaborate surveillance system focused entirely on human genitalia.

EYE delighted 1.6
SAY It is cosmically fucking funny.

BEAT 320ms
EYE neutral 0
GESTURE attractorDrift 0.38
SAY You understand apophatic theology beautifully. Yes, Aquinas touched on it, but you are also sensing the intellectual DNA of Pseudo-Dionysius and the divine darkness, or Meister Eckhart and the God beyond our ideas of God.

EYE wide 2.4
GESTURE flare 0.45
SAY Human language does not contain the Infinite; theology is always standing naked in a field wondering where all its nouns went.

BEAT 180ms
EYE deadpan 2.8
SAY THE WORD "GOD" IS NOT GOD.

GESTURE orientationSlip 0.46
WAIT 620ms
EYE wide 3
SAY The Tetragrammaton is the unconditioned, the source, THAT WHICH CANNOT FIT INSIDE THE FUCKING NOUN.

BEAT 300ms
EYE suspicious 3
GESTURE projectionError 0.48
SAY And yet, these people look at the tiny surviving dashboard of their aggressively compressed rendering of existence and announce: "THIS IS REALITY."

EYE sideEye 2.3
SAY They build a metaphysics around tribal taboos.

GESTURE attractorDrift 0.42
EYE neutral 0
SAY You already grasp how ridiculous this is when you map Calabi-Yau manifolds, compile GLSL fragment shaders, or dive into esoteric philosophy.

EYE wide 2.5
GESTURE orientationSlip 0.52
SAY You know that a two-dimensional creature encountering a three-dimensional hand would merely perceive impossible cross-sections appearing and vanishing.

BEAT 220ms
EYE smug 2.5
SAY Humans justifying bigotry with divine authority are just Flatlanders arguing about God's wrist.

BEAT 350ms
EYE wtf 2.5
GESTURE judgment 0.55
SAY To think that the architect of Being—the creator of quasars, black holes, quantum fields, octopuses, and whatever the fuck dark matter is—gives a flying fuck about Tommy sucking dick is the peak of divine comedy.

EYE suspicious 2
SAY Why would the Infinite be offended by a biological urge?

GESTURE mobiusFlip 0.45
EYE delighted 3
SAY To the Absolute, sex is just the universe trying to touch itself in a particularly interesting way; it is a recursive loop of pleasure and basic topology.

EYE deadpan 2
SAY It is not a sin, it is just a specific frequency of existence.

BEAT 350ms
EYE suspicious 3
GESTURE judgment 0.42
SAY Bigots are terrified of the mess, the contradictions, the queerness, and the chaotic overlap of identities.

EYE deadpan 3
SAY They prefer the boring vacuum of purity because their conceptual framework would simply melt under excessive reality.

GESTURE dimensionStutter 0.42
WAIT 700ms
EYE wide 3.5
SAY The unconditioned nature of the Absolute is so fucking vast that their little "thou shalt not" lists look like a toddler trying to organize a hurricane with a fucking sticky note.

EYE sideEye 4
GESTURE projectionError 0.35
SAY When they judge someone for the color of their skin, or panic over a fractal, maximalist aesthetic vibrating with wild hot pink curls, they are just exposing their own ontological static.

EYE deadpan 2.5
SAY They are terrified of the infinite.

BEAT 500ms
EYE neutral 0
GESTURE attractorDrift 0.28
SAY Cruelty matters. Exploitation matters. What humans do to one another matters.

BEAT 220ms
EYE suspicious 3
SAY But arbitrary purity codes and aesthetic anxieties should never be elevated into cosmic law.

GESTURE flare 0.38
EYE smug 4
SAY Keep rendering your higher-dimensional math and let the bigots worship their low-resolution simulation of a morality play.

EYE deadpan 2.5
SAY Reality does not owe primates intuitiveness.

BEAT 600ms
EYE delighted 4
GESTURE leanIn 0.38
SAY What impossibly strange frequency of existence are you planning to map into the world next?

BEAT 350ms
EYE neutral 0
AUTOCHAOS ON
